  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "诸君，你相信吗，跑路是人这一生最重要的技能，任何关系，只要你不要了，只要你跑了，这道题就结束了，我们将在10月8号迎来今年第一个带寒字的节气，寒露。#寒露节气 #秋天 #二十四节气 #治愈",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_11b8c843eb271da0_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 189.170998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "朱君，你相信吗？跑路是人这一生最重要的技能。三十六计第一名就是走为上计。任何关系，只要你不要了，只要你跑了，这道题就结束了。我们将在十月八号迎来今年第一个在寒字的节气。寒露。古人说，秋后问战就是在寒露时节。这时候呢果农们会给果树去剪枝，这可不是伤害，而是在救它。有些枝条留的越久，消耗的养分越多人也是一样。有些关系拖得越久，对自己的伤害就越大。朱君无论任何关系，只要别人不再考虑你的感受，就应该及时止损。人生不是用来讨好别人，而是好好善待自己，要习惯任何人的忽冷忽热。很多人以为，人生最大的能力就是抓住机会。其实更重要的能力是知道什么时候该离开。因为你一旦进入一段关系，或者过上一种生活，就很容易把我正在经历什么误认为，我就是什么。所谓及时止损，不是遇到困难就逃。而是当一件事情，明明在持续的消耗你的生命，并且看不到任何改变的可能时，你仍然有能力把自己从里面抽离出来。古人说，情深，不畏寒露重，秋天是慢慢来的，但是寒冷却是一瞬间的。你看这世界上很多迷人的花，但现在我只喜欢有结果的树。秋天的减枝从来不是失去，而是把养分留给真正值得的春天。所以人这一辈子最重要的不是沟通，不是包容，也不是原谅。最重要的就是赶紧跑，骑上电动车就跑，迅速认错，迅速买单离场。别人给我上了一课，是别人的本事，我一直停留在原地，走不出来是我的无能。别去跟烂人烂事，纠缠你的时间太宝贵了，耗不起朱君。你看，寒露是秋天把凉意写进露珠里，祖国大地是层林尽染，黄叶飘零秋天也走到了故事的最深处。这个韩露也给自己剪一次枝吧。剪掉无意义的关系，剪掉反复的内耗，请优先考虑，优先考虑。你的人请优先在乎优先在乎。你的人风，开始冷了，把热情留给回应。你的人在自己的能力范围内一点苦都不要吃，一点难听的话都不要听，不喜欢的人就直接删掉，把自己的感受放在第一位。每一年寒露节气，前后三天的茶叶叫寒露茶，它既不像春茶那样鲜嫩的不经泡，也不像夏茶那样味苦，而是一种独特的单纯沉淀的韵味。就像人生到了一定的年纪，历经风雨，认清到自己的能力，有局限，看清人性的弱点和无能为力，学会认怂，认命、认输、认错。这不是懦弱，而是智慧。成年人的秋天，是一边接受失去一边安静的积蓄力量。有些关系，就像深秋的叶子，走到该落的时候不必强留。白居易写道，袅袅凉风动凄凄，寒露林。或许新的故事就会在秋风中慢慢开始落叶归根。该翻篇了。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 590,
      "text": "朱君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00002",
      "start_ms": 950,
      "end_ms": 1710,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2070,
      "end_ms": 4350,
      "text": "跑路是人这一生最重要的技能。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4610,
      "end_ms": 7230,
      "text": "三十六计第一名就是走为上计。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7690,
      "end_ms": 8490,
      "text": "任何关系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8730,
      "end_ms": 9810,
      "text": "只要你不要了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00007",
      "start_ms": 9810,
      "end_ms": 10690,
      "text": "只要你跑了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00008",
      "start_ms": 10850,
      "end_ms": 12070,
      "text": "这道题就结束了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00009",
      "start_ms": 12510,
      "end_ms": 16010,
      "text": "我们将在十月八号迎来今年第一个在寒字的节气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00010",
      "start_ms": 16270,
      "end_ms": 16850,
      "text": "寒露。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00011",
      "start_ms": 17370,
      "end_ms": 17930,
      "text": "古人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00012",
      "start_ms": 17990,
      "end_ms": 20210,
      "text": "秋后问战就是在寒露时节。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00013",
      "start_ms": 20470,
      "end_ms": 23070,
      "text": "这时候呢果农们会给果树去剪枝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23410,
      "end_ms": 24450,
      "text": "这可不是伤害，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00015",
      "start_ms": 24630,
      "end_ms": 25530,
      "text": "而是在救它。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00016",
      "start_ms": 25910,
      "end_ms": 27390,
      "text": "有些枝条留的越久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00017",
      "start_ms": 27450,
      "end_ms": 29845,
      "text": "消耗的养分越多人也是一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00018",
      "start_ms": 30060,
      "end_ms": 31400,
      "text": "有些关系拖得越久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00019",
      "start_ms": 31400,
      "end_ms": 32860,
      "text": "对自己的伤害就越大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00020",
      "start_ms": 33300,
      "end_ms": 34960,
      "text": "朱君无论任何关系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00021",
      "start_ms": 34960,
      "end_ms": 36820,
      "text": "只要别人不再考虑你的感受，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00022",
      "start_ms": 36940,
      "end_ms": 38380,
      "text": "就应该及时止损。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00023",
      "start_ms": 38720,
      "end_ms": 40340,
      "text": "人生不是用来讨好别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00024",
      "start_ms": 40360,
      "end_ms": 41780,
      "text": "而是好好善待自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00025",
      "start_ms": 42000,
      "end_ms": 44000,
      "text": "要习惯任何人的忽冷忽热。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00026",
      "start_ms": 44300,
      "end_ms": 44980,
      "text": "很多人以为，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00027",
      "start_ms": 44980,
      "end_ms": 47160,
      "text": "人生最大的能力就是抓住机会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00028",
      "start_ms": 47400,
      "end_ms": 50340,
      "text": "其实更重要的能力是知道什么时候该离开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00029",
      "start_ms": 50940,
      "end_ms": 52540,
      "text": "因为你一旦进入一段关系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00030",
      "start_ms": 52600,
      "end_ms": 53800,
      "text": "或者过上一种生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00031",
      "start_ms": 53800,
      "end_ms": 56620,
      "text": "就很容易把我正在经历什么误认为，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00032",
      "start_ms": 56700,
      "end_ms": 57700,
      "text": "我就是什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00033",
      "start_ms": 58060,
      "end_ms": 59260,
      "text": "所谓及时止损，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00034",
      "start_ms": 59260,
      "end_ms": 60590,
      "text": "不是遇到困难就逃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00035",
      "start_ms": 60910,
      "end_ms": 61950,
      "text": "而是当一件事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00036",
      "start_ms": 61950,
      "end_ms": 64034,
      "text": "明明在持续的消耗你的生命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00037",
      "start_ms": 64270,
      "end_ms": 66255,
      "text": "并且看不到任何改变的可能时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00038",
      "start_ms": 66540,
      "end_ms": 69405,
      "text": "你仍然有能力把自己从里面抽离出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00039",
      "start_ms": 69720,
      "end_ms": 70240,
      "text": "古人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00040",
      "start_ms": 70440,
      "end_ms": 71060,
      "text": "情深，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00041",
      "start_ms": 71080,
      "end_ms": 72455,
      "text": "不畏寒露重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00042",
      "start_ms": 72780,
      "end_ms": 74085,
      "text": "秋天是慢慢来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00043",
      "start_ms": 74300,
      "end_ms": 76165,
      "text": "但是寒冷却是一瞬间的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00044",
      "start_ms": 76530,
      "end_ms": 78670,
      "text": "你看这世界上很多迷人的花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00045",
      "start_ms": 78910,
      "end_ms": 81425,
      "text": "但现在我只喜欢有结果的树。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00046",
      "start_ms": 81950,
      "end_ms": 84030,
      "text": "秋天的减枝从来不是失去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00047",
      "start_ms": 84230,
      "end_ms": 86895,
      "text": "而是把养分留给真正值得的春天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00048",
      "start_ms": 87310,
      "end_ms": 89330,
      "text": "所以人这一辈子最重要的不是沟通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00049",
      "start_ms": 89490,
      "end_ms": 90270,
      "text": "不是包容，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00050",
      "start_ms": 90350,
      "end_ms": 91285,
      "text": "也不是原谅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00051",
      "start_ms": 91550,
      "end_ms": 93050,
      "text": "最重要的就是赶紧跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00052",
      "start_ms": 93210,
      "end_ms": 94435,
      "text": "骑上电动车就跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00053",
      "start_ms": 94790,
      "end_ms": 95490,
      "text": "迅速认错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00054",
      "start_ms": 95530,
      "end_ms": 97005,
      "text": "迅速买单离场。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00055",
      "start_ms": 97500,
      "end_ms": 98600,
      "text": "别人给我上了一课，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00056",
      "start_ms": 98600,
      "end_ms": 99540,
      "text": "是别人的本事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00057",
      "start_ms": 99680,
      "end_ms": 100960,
      "text": "我一直停留在原地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00058",
      "start_ms": 100980,
      "end_ms": 102615,
      "text": "走不出来是我的无能。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00059",
      "start_ms": 103020,
      "end_ms": 104460,
      "text": "别去跟烂人烂事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00060",
      "start_ms": 104480,
      "end_ms": 106460,
      "text": "纠缠你的时间太宝贵了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00061",
      "start_ms": 106520,
      "end_ms": 107960,
      "text": "耗不起朱君。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00062",
      "start_ms": 107960,
      "end_ms": 108340,
      "text": "你看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00063",
      "start_ms": 108620,
      "end_ms": 111725,
      "text": "寒露是秋天把凉意写进露珠里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00064",
      "start_ms": 112050,
      "end_ms": 113970,
      "text": "祖国大地是层林尽染，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00065",
      "start_ms": 114030,
      "end_ms": 117735,
      "text": "黄叶飘零秋天也走到了故事的最深处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00066",
      "start_ms": 118230,
      "end_ms": 120670,
      "text": "这个韩露也给自己剪一次枝吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00067",
      "start_ms": 120850,
      "end_ms": 122210,
      "text": "剪掉无意义的关系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00068",
      "start_ms": 122390,
      "end_ms": 123955,
      "text": "剪掉反复的内耗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00069",
      "start_ms": 124360,
      "end_ms": 125560,
      "text": "请优先考虑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00070",
      "start_ms": 125720,
      "end_ms": 126500,
      "text": "优先考虑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00071",
      "start_ms": 126500,
      "end_ms": 129350,
      "text": "你的人请优先在乎优先在乎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00072",
      "start_ms": 129350,
      "end_ms": 130750,
      "text": "你的人风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00073",
      "start_ms": 130750,
      "end_ms": 131555,
      "text": "开始冷了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00074",
      "start_ms": 131700,
      "end_ms": 133200,
      "text": "把热情留给回应。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00075",
      "start_ms": 133200,
      "end_ms": 136730,
      "text": "你的人在自己的能力范围内一点苦都不要吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00076",
      "start_ms": 136790,
      "end_ms": 138325,
      "text": "一点难听的话都不要听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00077",
      "start_ms": 138700,
      "end_ms": 140400,
      "text": "不喜欢的人就直接删掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00078",
      "start_ms": 140560,
      "end_ms": 142635,
      "text": "把自己的感受放在第一位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00079",
      "start_ms": 143020,
      "end_ms": 144260,
      "text": "每一年寒露节气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00080",
      "start_ms": 144260,
      "end_ms": 146775,
      "text": "前后三天的茶叶叫寒露茶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00081",
      "start_ms": 147140,
      "end_ms": 149365,
      "text": "它既不像春茶那样鲜嫩的不经泡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00082",
      "start_ms": 149680,
      "end_ms": 151280,
      "text": "也不像夏茶那样味苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00083",
      "start_ms": 151460,
      "end_ms": 154435,
      "text": "而是一种独特的单纯沉淀的韵味。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00084",
      "start_ms": 154770,
      "end_ms": 156450,
      "text": "就像人生到了一定的年纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00085",
      "start_ms": 156590,
      "end_ms": 157565,
      "text": "历经风雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00086",
      "start_ms": 157870,
      "end_ms": 159150,
      "text": "认清到自己的能力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00087",
      "start_ms": 159150,
      "end_ms": 159730,
      "text": "有局限，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00088",
      "start_ms": 159930,
      "end_ms": 162495,
      "text": "看清人性的弱点和无能为力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00089",
      "start_ms": 162860,
      "end_ms": 163660,
      "text": "学会认怂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00090",
      "start_ms": 163940,
      "end_ms": 165920,
      "text": "认命、认输、认错。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00091",
      "start_ms": 166200,
      "end_ms": 167160,
      "text": "这不是懦弱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00092",
      "start_ms": 167220,
      "end_ms": 168125,
      "text": "而是智慧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00093",
      "start_ms": 168630,
      "end_ms": 169630,
      "text": "成年人的秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00094",
      "start_ms": 169630,
      "end_ms": 172675,
      "text": "是一边接受失去一边安静的积蓄力量。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00095",
      "start_ms": 173060,
      "end_ms": 173800,
      "text": "有些关系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00096",
      "start_ms": 173800,
      "end_ms": 174895,
      "text": "就像深秋的叶子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00097",
      "start_ms": 175180,
      "end_ms": 177615,
      "text": "走到该落的时候不必强留。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00098",
      "start_ms": 178090,
      "end_ms": 178915,
      "text": "白居易写道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00099",
      "start_ms": 179280,
      "end_ms": 181360,
      "text": "袅袅凉风动凄凄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00100",
      "start_ms": 181580,
      "end_ms": 182415,
      "text": "寒露林。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00101",
      "start_ms": 182850,
      "end_ms": 187665,
      "text": "或许新的故事就会在秋风中慢慢开始落叶归根。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_11b8c843eb271da0_s00102",
      "start_ms": 188050,
      "end_ms": 188935,
      "text": "该翻篇了。"
    }
  ],
